B. Implicit data type conversion.
C. The query returns a large percentage of the table's rows.
D. All of the above.

## 7. How many rows will be returned by the following Oracle SQL query?

```sql
SELECT DISTINCT Val
FROM (
    SELECT 1 AS Val FROM DUAL
    UNION ALL
    SELECT 1 FROM DUAL
    UNION ALL
    SELECT NULL FROM DUAL
    UNION ALL
    SELECT NULL FROM DUAL
);
```

A. 1
B. 2
C. 3
D. 4

