## 11. Find the error in the following Oracle SQL query.

```sql
SELECT employee_id,
       ROW_NUMBER() OVER (
           PARTITION BY department_id
           ORDER BY hire_date
       ) AS rn
FROM employees
WHERE rn <= 3;
```

A. ROW_NUMBER() cannot be used with PARTITION BY.
B. Window function aliases cannot be referenced in the WHERE clause at the same query level.
C. ORDER BY cannot be used inside OVER().
D. ROW_NUMBER() requires GROUP BY.

